  "_doc": [
    "Shot list for the 28 s Monkey Money trailer. Edit this file to re-time scenes or re-point clips - no code changes needed.",
    "Times are trailer seconds. The cut grid follows the music: theme_main.m4a is 139.89 BPM, beat n lands at beat.t0 + n*60/bpm (2.2, 2.629, 3.058, ...). Animations inside a scene are relative to its 'in' and scale with beats.",
    "Clip forms (any slot): {\"page\":\"stage\",\"from\":t0,\"to\":t1,\"speed\":1} plays that footage range (frame = last frame with t <= from + (time in shot)*speed, clamped to 'to');",
    "  {\"page\":\"stage\",\"scene\":\"frage-affenzahn-speed\",\"nth\":0,\"offset\":0.4} resolves 'from' via footage/events.json (nth event of that scene on 'scenePage' (default: the clip's page, else any page), plus offset);",
    "  {\"still\":\"/abs/path.png\"} shows an image. A slot may carry page AND still: footage is used when footage/<page>/index.json exists (and the scene resolves), otherwise the still.",
    "  Optional per clip: fit (cover|contain), focus [x,y] 0..1 (object-position + zoom origin), zoom [z0,z1] (push-in over the shot), aspect (device/screen aspect w/h), ",
    "  spin {cx,cy,r,deg} (stills only: rotate a circular crop, e.g. the Gluecksrad; r relative to image width), hold true (freeze first frame), preferStill true (use the still even when footage resolves), segments [{at, from|scene/offset, speed, still}] (several source ranges inside one layer).",
    "  {\"page\":\"gm\",\"what\":\"Frage bannen\",\"offset\":-0.3} (or \"cmd\":\"questionBan\") resolves from a recorded action instead: the nth events.json entry on that page whose detail.what contains the text (detail.cmd equal), plus offset. Survives re-recordings as long as the script performs the same actions.",
    "Taps: footage clips of phone/gm pages get finger-tap ripples automatically from events.json tap actions inside the played range (autoTaps:false to disable). 'taps' [[x,y,t],…] (x,y 0..1, t = trailer time) are used when the still fallback is shown."
  ],
